# FoundryDesk CRM lead-capture endpoint.
#
# Both values are PUBLIC — they are inlined into the static build and shipped
# to every visitor's browser. The captureToken is not a hard secret; it
# identifies the brand bucket on the CRM, where the endpoint applies
# IP rate-limiting and spam-checking.
#
# To obtain the token:
#   1. Run the FoundryDesk CRM
#   2. Sign in, create a Business, then create a Brand under it with slug "babyblocks"
#   3. Copy the captureToken field from that Brand row in the database
#   4. Set the values below; restart the build
#
# Until both are set, the waitlist form will show a "you're on the list"
# confirmation but will not actually persist. This keeps the UX clean while
# you wire up.
PUBLIC_CRM_LEAD_URL="https://crm.intriguemmc.com/api/leads/babyblocks"
PUBLIC_CRM_LEAD_TOKEN=""
